1
00:01:38,500 --> 00:01:43,030
[Shadow Punisher]

2
00:01:43,080 --> 00:01:43,720
[Divine Constable Tally]

3
00:01:43,720 --> 00:01:45,870
[Episode 20]

4
00:01:55,680 --> 00:01:56,479
I presume

5
00:01:57,039 --> 00:01:58,680
this is the former citizen of Liluo

6
00:01:58,680 --> 00:02:00,310
you've been suspecting

7
00:02:00,310 --> 00:02:01,760
all along.

8
00:02:03,280 --> 00:02:05,000
You don't actually suspect

9
00:02:08,310 --> 00:02:10,360
that I'm from Liluo, do you?

10
00:02:17,310 --> 00:02:18,240
Master.

11
00:02:20,800 --> 00:02:22,630
You raised me for 17 years,

12
00:02:23,680 --> 00:02:24,960
fed me,

13
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:27,010
taught me martial arts,

14
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:30,190
and instructed me in the mystical arts,

15
00:02:30,190 --> 00:02:32,190
medicine, divination, and astrology.

16
00:02:32,190 --> 00:02:33,590
Such kindness and grace—

17
00:02:36,190 --> 00:02:39,120
I, Li Si, shall never forget them
for as long as I live.

18
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,660
And I, Zhou Yan,

19
00:02:44,470 --> 00:02:46,930
shall carry them in my heart forever
as well.

20
00:02:47,190 --> 00:02:48,000
Chang Bo.

21
00:02:48,630 --> 00:02:50,680
When you joined
the Divine Constable Bureau,

22
00:02:50,680 --> 00:02:52,470
I wasn't Chief yet.

23
00:02:52,800 --> 00:02:54,190
You and I were colleagues.

24
00:02:52,870 --> 00:02:55,800
[Former Head Constable of
the Divine Constable Bureau, Chang Bo]

25
00:02:54,840 --> 00:02:55,910
Given your experience,

26
00:02:55,910 --> 00:02:57,770
if you had remained in the Bureau,

27
00:02:57,840 --> 00:03:00,360
you would undoubtedly have secured a place

28
00:03:00,470 --> 00:03:02,800
among the current Four Divine Constables.

29
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,500
Chief, you flatter me.

30
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:06,280
You're saying he was with
the Divine Constable Bureau?

31
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,710
Seventeen years ago,

32
00:03:08,280 --> 00:03:10,470
after the incident
at Mulan Hunting Ground,

33
00:03:10,470 --> 00:03:12,400
I took over as Chief.

34
00:03:12,870 --> 00:03:14,280
The first thing I did

35
00:03:14,800 --> 00:03:17,150
was expel Chang Bo from the Bureau

36
00:03:17,470 --> 00:03:19,120
and have him secretly investigate

37
00:03:19,120 --> 00:03:21,450
the whereabouts of the remnants of Liluo.

38
00:03:21,840 --> 00:03:22,960
Li Si said

39
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:25,430
he had people searching everywhere
for you,

40
00:03:25,430 --> 00:03:27,800
claiming you'd been frequenting
Lanyue Pavilion.

41
00:03:27,800 --> 00:03:29,680
I only frequented Lanyue Pavilion

42
00:03:29,680 --> 00:03:31,310
in search of a person—

43
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:32,960
a Liluo citizen.

44
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:34,000
You mean the former citizen of Liluo

45
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:35,590
who incited Tang Wei and Tang Yiming

46
00:03:35,590 --> 00:03:36,630
to commit murder?

47
00:03:36,800 --> 00:03:38,680
I know nothing of this person's

48
00:03:38,680 --> 00:03:40,790
identity, background, or real name.

49
00:03:40,910 --> 00:03:42,190
For seventeen years,

50
00:03:42,190 --> 00:03:43,520
I've traveled far and wide,

51
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:44,630
working day and night,

52
00:03:44,630 --> 00:03:46,470
and all I've managed to uncover
is a surname:

53
00:03:46,470 --> 00:03:48,800
Li—as in "common people."

54
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:50,790
And it's also the "Li" in the name of
Divine Constable Qingyang,

55
00:03:50,790 --> 00:03:52,120
Li Si.

56
00:03:56,430 --> 00:03:57,680
I've always believed

57
00:04:00,030 --> 00:04:01,090
that our encounter

58
00:04:01,870 --> 00:04:03,600
in the deep mountains that year

59
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:06,360
was just a coincidence.

60
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,750
But so much has happened lately

61
00:04:16,040 --> 00:04:17,560
that I can't help but think

62
00:04:18,680 --> 00:04:20,410
there was more to our encounter

63
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,430
than I realized.

64
00:04:46,830 --> 00:04:48,360
I've known you for years,

65
00:04:50,040 --> 00:04:51,240
and this is the first time

66
00:04:51,240 --> 00:04:53,500
I've heard you talk in circles like this.

67
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:56,510
If you have something to say,

68
00:04:56,510 --> 00:04:57,310
just say it.

69
00:05:02,430 --> 00:05:04,090
I'd like to meet Lou Tianming.

70
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,430
I'm guessing

71
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:10,240
you two have known each other

72
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,920
for quite some time, haven't you?

73
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:12,950
Lou Tianming?

74
00:05:13,870 --> 00:05:14,830
Let me think.

75
00:05:14,830 --> 00:05:16,480
Lou Tianming...

76
00:05:16,830 --> 00:05:20,000
Lou Tianming, Lou Tianming,
Lou Tianming...

77
00:05:20,430 --> 00:05:21,750
I don't know him.

78
00:05:23,800 --> 00:05:24,800
Do you believe me?

79
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:42,040
I don't know him!

80
00:05:43,070 --> 00:05:44,870
I really don't know him.

81
00:05:47,430 --> 00:05:49,230
If only I could actually say that

82
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:52,730
and you would actually believe it.

83
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,240
If that were the case,

84
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:04,510
then wouldn't you have spent
those 17 years

85
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:06,310
raising a fool, Master?

86
00:06:08,480 --> 00:06:10,610
Those who are too wise often die young.

87
00:06:11,000 --> 00:06:12,930
Sometimes, being a little foolish

88
00:06:13,190 --> 00:06:15,000
helps you live longer.

89
00:06:18,630 --> 00:06:19,430
Master.

90
00:06:20,680 --> 00:06:22,370
Weren't you just telling me

91
00:06:22,630 --> 00:06:24,240
not to beat around the bush?

92
00:06:24,240 --> 00:06:25,040
Why

93
00:06:25,600 --> 00:06:27,860
are you the one changing the subject now?

94
00:06:32,830 --> 00:06:34,490
There's too much I want to say,

95
00:06:37,430 --> 00:06:39,560
and I simply don't know where to start.

96
00:06:41,070 --> 00:06:42,400
Then should I ask first,

97
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,800
or will you speak first, Master?

98
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,310
I'll ask first.

99
00:06:50,390 --> 00:06:52,310
When did you start suspecting me?

100
00:06:58,480 --> 00:06:59,430
A few days ago,

101
00:07:00,040 --> 00:07:01,700
at Jiang Zeshui's residence,

102
00:07:01,830 --> 00:07:04,030
we captured a demon-men assassin alive

103
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,930
and threw him into
the Divine Constable Bureau's prison.

104
00:07:07,930 --> 00:07:09,240
What happened?

105
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,000
He endured all those tortures
without breaking.

106
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,730
Why did he suddenly go berserk?

107
00:07:13,000 --> 00:07:14,870
The way that demon-man went berserk

108
00:07:14,870 --> 00:07:16,190
was remarkably similar to how I am

109
00:07:16,190 --> 00:07:19,520
when my heart meridians flare up
and the burning takes hold.

110
00:07:20,190 --> 00:07:22,600
Then something happened

111
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:25,120
that suddenly improved

112
00:07:25,270 --> 00:07:27,000
his condition.

113
00:07:33,190 --> 00:07:34,480
There are still a few pills left inside.

114
00:07:34,480 --> 00:07:35,610
Save them for later.

115
00:07:39,630 --> 00:07:41,159
When I picked the bottle up,

116
00:07:41,830 --> 00:07:42,830
the pills inside

117
00:07:43,390 --> 00:07:44,680
were already gone.

118
00:07:45,430 --> 00:07:46,240
That was when

119
00:07:47,430 --> 00:07:48,720
I realized.

120
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:53,000
This medicine has a name.

121
00:07:53,240 --> 00:07:55,270
It's called the Demon-Suppressing Pill.

122
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:57,070
It's used to suppress

123
00:07:57,070 --> 00:07:59,040
the Chiying Bug Venom
within demon-men's bodies.

124
00:07:59,040 --> 00:08:00,560
If not taken regularly,

125
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,720
the victim will lose their mind,

126
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:03,800
suffer unbearable pain,

127
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:05,260
go berserk,

128
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,750
and eventually die.

129
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:16,120
The first time you fell ill that year

130
00:08:17,480 --> 00:08:19,630
was exactly when the Chiying Bug Venom
I had planted in you

131
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:21,040
took effect.

132
00:08:30,190 --> 00:08:31,720
Master...

133
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,440
Save me...

134
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,289
Save me...

135
00:08:39,440 --> 00:08:41,640
So you've finally admitted it yourself

136
00:08:42,030 --> 00:08:43,200
that what I have is

137
00:08:43,789 --> 00:08:45,630
the Chiying Bug Venom.

138
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:56,720
And of course, you know now

139
00:08:57,080 --> 00:08:59,080
that what I've been preparing for you
every month

140
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:02,510
isn't some "All-Nourishing Pill",

141
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,120
but rather the "Demon-Suppressing Pill",

142
00:09:05,120 --> 00:09:07,720
designed to suppress
the worm toxin within you

143
00:09:08,030 --> 00:09:09,890
that could flare up at any moment.

144
00:09:12,840 --> 00:09:14,150
Seventeen years ago,

145
00:09:15,440 --> 00:09:19,420
the Fourth Prince, Zhou Yan,
was exceptionally gifted

146
00:09:19,790 --> 00:09:22,010
and deeply favored by the Emperor.

147
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:23,750
Everyone was convinced

148
00:09:23,790 --> 00:09:26,050
that the one to inherit the throne one day

149
00:09:27,630 --> 00:09:29,440
would definitely be Zhou Yan.

150
00:09:30,480 --> 00:09:33,680
Zhou Yan accompanied His Majesty
on a hunting expedition

151
00:09:34,080 --> 00:09:35,910
when he suffered a tragic accident

152
00:09:35,910 --> 00:09:37,750
and met an untimely death.

153
00:09:39,510 --> 00:09:40,790
Everyone assumed

154
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,440
Zhou Yan had died of illness,

155
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,030
but in truth,

156
00:09:45,790 --> 00:09:47,240
this so-called accident

157
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:49,120
was a

158
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:52,240
carefully orchestrated murder.

159
00:09:52,790 --> 00:09:54,000
You kept saying

160
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:56,080
you wanted to uncover the truth.

161
00:09:56,630 --> 00:09:58,320
So tell me now—

162
00:09:58,630 --> 00:10:01,120
who was the real culprit?

163
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,800
Although my eldest and second brothers

164
00:10:08,000 --> 00:10:09,440
have never gotten along,

165
00:10:09,870 --> 00:10:11,960
they show surprising unity

166
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:14,800
when faced with a common threat.

167
00:10:15,630 --> 00:10:17,560
If your eldest brother had done it,

168
00:10:17,720 --> 00:10:18,840
the Emperor would surely

169
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:21,170
have punished him once the truth came out,

170
00:10:21,320 --> 00:10:22,870
leaving your second brother

171
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:25,600
secure on the Crown Prince's throne.

172
00:10:26,080 --> 00:10:28,240
But if your second brother had done it,

173
00:10:28,670 --> 00:10:31,080
the Emperor could've easily
flown into a rage

174
00:10:31,080 --> 00:10:32,810
and replaced the Crown Prince.

175
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:36,080
Either one acting alone

176
00:10:36,840 --> 00:10:39,240
would only benefit the other.

177
00:10:40,390 --> 00:10:44,000
The only way for both of them to succeed

178
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:47,120
was to join forces.

179
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:50,970
As expected of you, Master.

180
00:10:51,600 --> 00:10:52,400
You're right.

181
00:10:53,440 --> 00:10:55,720
But even if Father uncovered the truth,

182
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:59,120
what could he really do
to my eldest and second brothers?

183
00:10:59,120 --> 00:11:01,200
Would he depose them both?

184
00:11:02,030 --> 00:11:03,550
And if he did,

185
00:11:03,910 --> 00:11:05,360
who would inherit

186
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:07,840
his empire?

187
00:11:12,510 --> 00:11:14,910
Back then, the Crown Prince set a trap
to have you killed.

188
00:11:14,910 --> 00:11:16,040
Your eldest brother

189
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,200
used his position in the Ministry of War

190
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:20,000
to fabricate military reports,

191
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:22,000
keeping your father from

192
00:11:22,510 --> 00:11:24,640
reaching the hunting grounds in time.

193
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:27,480
We learned of

194
00:11:27,480 --> 00:11:29,540
the assassination plot beforehand.

195
00:11:30,320 --> 00:11:31,120
Therefore,

196
00:11:32,000 --> 00:11:33,750
we were prepared.

197
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:49,150
Like Lou Tianming,

198
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:52,480
you're both members of Liluo's Dark Night.

199
00:11:52,720 --> 00:11:54,080
You found a household

200
00:11:54,080 --> 00:11:55,870
on the outskirts of Tianhuang City—

201
00:11:55,870 --> 00:11:57,390
a small family

202
00:11:57,840 --> 00:11:59,480
with no other relatives.

203
00:12:00,630 --> 00:12:01,490
As it happened,

204
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,960
they had a child

205
00:12:04,630 --> 00:12:06,120
who was the same age as me.

206
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,720
The Shen family.

207
00:12:08,930 --> 00:12:10,490
Shen Lan.

208
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,580
You sent demon-men

209
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,630
to slaughter the entire Shen family

210
00:12:14,630 --> 00:12:16,200
and took Shen Lan to the hunting grounds,

211
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:17,900
-Go home!
-dressed him in my clothes,

212
00:12:17,900 --> 00:12:21,600
-I want to go home!
-so that the Eastern Palace assassins

213
00:12:21,670 --> 00:12:24,470
would mistake Shen Lan for me
and kill him instead.

214
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:29,390
Then, just as planned,

215
00:12:29,910 --> 00:12:31,750
you burned his body,

216
00:12:32,600 --> 00:12:35,530
took me away, and abandoned me
deep in the mountains.

217
00:12:35,870 --> 00:12:36,670
Finally,

218
00:12:37,200 --> 00:12:38,530
you staged the whole act

219
00:12:39,510 --> 00:12:41,960
of Li San rescuing the Crown Prince.

220
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,080
My father,

221
00:12:44,870 --> 00:12:45,930
my eldest brother,

222
00:12:46,440 --> 00:12:47,640
and my second brother

223
00:12:47,840 --> 00:12:48,770
were, of course,

224
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:51,630
completely unaware of this.

225
00:12:53,200 --> 00:12:54,720
Flawless, wasn't it?

226
00:12:57,670 --> 00:12:59,110
They all believed

227
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,440
you were dead.

228
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:05,930
-Chief.
-Chief.

229
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,120
We've searched everywhere.

230
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:07,910
There was no trace.

231
00:13:07,910 --> 00:13:09,440
And Meng Rui is currently

232
00:13:09,440 --> 00:13:10,840
nowhere to be found, either.

233
00:13:10,840 --> 00:13:11,630
Chief.

234
00:13:11,840 --> 00:13:12,840
I believe

235
00:13:13,200 --> 00:13:14,790
that Li Si's master, Li San,

236
00:13:14,790 --> 00:13:16,390
is a former citizen of Liluo.

237
00:13:16,630 --> 00:13:17,390
The two of them

238
00:13:17,390 --> 00:13:19,190
must be together at this moment.

239
00:13:21,240 --> 00:13:22,170
Pass on my order.

240
00:13:22,200 --> 00:13:23,240
Search the entire city

241
00:13:23,240 --> 00:13:24,870
for Li Si and Li San.

242
00:13:29,030 --> 00:13:29,840
-Yes.
-Yes.

243
00:13:30,000 --> 00:13:32,200
Master, it's not hard to guess

244
00:13:32,910 --> 00:13:34,360
why you raised me.

245
00:13:36,030 --> 00:13:37,150
Dark Night

246
00:13:38,000 --> 00:13:38,840
only needed to

247
00:13:38,840 --> 00:13:40,550
keep me alive.

248
00:13:41,270 --> 00:13:42,320
Yet Master,

249
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:45,440
you taught me martial arts,

250
00:13:45,910 --> 00:13:47,750
astronomy, geography,

251
00:13:47,870 --> 00:13:49,630
medicine, divination, and astrology.

252
00:13:49,630 --> 00:13:50,440
You even

253
00:13:52,200 --> 00:13:54,800
passed the Heaven-Measuring Ruler
down to me.

254
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:57,550
I am deeply grateful.

255
00:14:00,390 --> 00:14:01,270
But I suspect

256
00:14:02,630 --> 00:14:04,630
your true intention was to have me

257
00:14:06,910 --> 00:14:09,170
take part in the struggle for the throne.

258
00:14:10,960 --> 00:14:11,750
After all,

259
00:14:12,080 --> 00:14:13,270
a crippled man

260
00:14:14,270 --> 00:14:16,440
would stand no chance against
my eldest and second brothers.

261
00:14:16,440 --> 00:14:18,200
But if a Fourth Prince like you,

262
00:14:18,200 --> 00:14:20,360
now dashing and handsome,

263
00:14:20,360 --> 00:14:21,270
skilled in both
the civil and martial arts,

264
00:14:21,270 --> 00:14:23,320
and wealthy beyond measure,

265
00:14:26,000 --> 00:14:28,750
were to suddenly appear
before your father,

266
00:14:30,030 --> 00:14:30,840
then he...

267
00:14:31,240 --> 00:14:32,270
he would be tempted

268
00:14:32,270 --> 00:14:34,790
to make you his heir.

269
00:14:36,630 --> 00:14:38,150
Liluo has fallen.

270
00:14:39,200 --> 00:14:40,750
Dark Night alone

271
00:14:41,320 --> 00:14:43,000
could never restore the kingdom.

272
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:43,960
But if

273
00:14:45,390 --> 00:14:47,600
they hold in their hands
the future emperor—

274
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,750
who must take

275
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,000
your specific antidote every month

276
00:14:53,120 --> 00:14:54,550
without fail—

277
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:57,830
then restoring Liluo

278
00:14:58,910 --> 00:15:00,570
will no longer be a mere dream.

279
00:15:02,020 --> 00:15:03,600
Look at the Eastern Palace today

280
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:06,860
and the First Prince who's been
placed under house arrest.

281
00:15:07,670 --> 00:15:08,510
The throne

282
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:11,520
is meant for none other than you.

283
00:15:38,390 --> 00:15:39,480
No matter what,

284
00:15:44,240 --> 00:15:45,950
I owe my thanks to

285
00:15:48,440 --> 00:15:50,240
you, Master, and Dark Night.

286
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:52,720
If it weren't for you,

287
00:15:53,450 --> 00:15:54,550
I would have died at the hands of

288
00:15:54,550 --> 00:15:56,750
my eldest and second brothers long ago.

289
00:15:57,630 --> 00:16:00,150
On behalf of Zhou Yan, I, Li Si,

290
00:16:02,670 --> 00:16:05,270
would like to thank you
for raising me, Master.

291
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:08,200
And I'd like to thank the people of Liluo

292
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,390
for saving my life.

293
00:16:15,030 --> 00:16:17,970
Fate cannot be defied!

294
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:21,280
Heaven's grace is boundless!

295
00:16:25,670 --> 00:16:26,840
You must understand

296
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:29,720
that everything I did

297
00:16:30,480 --> 00:16:32,790
was to help you reclaim

298
00:16:33,600 --> 00:16:36,670
the throne that was yours by right.

299
00:16:39,510 --> 00:16:41,200
As long as you obey me,

300
00:16:42,840 --> 00:16:44,790
the Chiying Bug Venom in your body

301
00:16:47,320 --> 00:16:49,200
will never flare up again.

302
00:16:58,510 --> 00:17:00,200
My dear disciple.

303
00:17:11,890 --> 00:17:12,740
Master.

304
00:17:14,200 --> 00:17:15,700
Do you understand

305
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:19,240
what I meant when I said,
"On behalf of Zhou Yan,

306
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:21,960
I, Li Si, thank you?"

307
00:17:32,270 --> 00:17:34,240
Zhou Yan died long ago.

308
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:37,340
So how could he possibly
inherit the throne?

309
00:18:13,720 --> 00:18:16,430
How dare you deceive me?

310
00:18:27,270 --> 00:18:29,290
Why didn't you dodge?

311
00:18:30,400 --> 00:18:32,020
Master,

312
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:33,880
save me.

313
00:18:34,720 --> 00:18:36,200
-It hurts.
-I'm here.

314
00:18:36,200 --> 00:18:36,970
It hurts.

315
00:18:37,310 --> 00:18:38,320
It hurts.

316
00:18:38,830 --> 00:18:39,640
I'm here.

317
00:18:39,640 --> 00:18:40,840
It's okay. It's okay.

318
00:18:53,110 --> 00:18:54,640
It's okay. you're fine now.

319
00:18:56,510 --> 00:18:57,310
Master.

320
00:18:57,680 --> 00:18:58,920
When I grow up,

321
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:01,510
I'll also make locust flower pancakes
for you.

322
00:19:01,510 --> 00:19:02,400
Do you mean it?

323
00:19:02,510 --> 00:19:03,350
I do.

324
00:19:03,350 --> 00:19:03,920
Pinky swear?

325
00:19:03,920 --> 00:19:05,640
Cross my heart, for real,

326
00:19:05,640 --> 00:19:07,480
-on god, pinky swear.
-on god, pinky swear.

327
00:19:07,480 --> 00:19:09,310
Whoever breaks his word is a pig.

328
00:19:11,920 --> 00:19:12,720
Master.

329
00:19:12,830 --> 00:19:15,360
You saved me,
an abandoned child of Great Shi.

330
00:19:15,680 --> 00:19:17,340
That was a life-saving grace.

331
00:19:18,110 --> 00:19:20,440
If the day ever comes when we meet
on the battlefield,

332
00:19:20,440 --> 00:19:22,300
and you must take my life, Master,

333
00:19:22,440 --> 00:19:24,590
I won't hold it against you.

334
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,310
That strike—

335
00:19:27,720 --> 00:19:29,070
I was willing to take it.

336
00:19:30,440 --> 00:19:32,470
If you want to sever ties with me,

337
00:19:33,680 --> 00:19:35,560
why wait until then?

338
00:20:13,400 --> 00:20:15,270
You raised me,
an abandoned child of Great Shi,

339
00:20:15,270 --> 00:20:16,440
for 17 years.

340
00:20:18,230 --> 00:20:20,360
For that, I owe you a debt of gratitude.

341
00:20:21,590 --> 00:20:23,400
You and I stand on opposite sides,

342
00:20:23,400 --> 00:20:25,000
each serving our own master.

343
00:20:25,640 --> 00:20:26,680
If you

344
00:20:27,790 --> 00:20:29,790
insist on remaining loyal to Liluo,

345
00:20:30,590 --> 00:20:31,790
I would never presume

346
00:20:33,000 --> 00:20:35,030
to say that you are in the wrong.

347
00:20:37,310 --> 00:20:38,480
That second strike—

348
00:20:39,680 --> 00:20:41,450
I was also willing to take it.

349
00:21:03,160 --> 00:21:03,960
Master.

350
00:21:05,960 --> 00:21:06,750
Now that

351
00:21:07,880 --> 00:21:11,310
this piece has returned to the board,

352
00:21:11,990 --> 00:21:14,120
I hold a position of great importance.

353
00:21:14,480 --> 00:21:16,880
I owe it all to your guidance
and teachings.

354
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,750
I'll follow your example

355
00:21:20,590 --> 00:21:22,550
and protect my homeland,

356
00:21:23,440 --> 00:21:25,100
and personally slay the enemy

357
00:21:26,030 --> 00:21:28,270
in defense of our Great Shi Empire.

358
00:21:54,000 --> 00:21:55,310
You are

359
00:21:56,030 --> 00:21:58,030
seeking your own death.

360
00:22:10,960 --> 00:22:11,960
You promised

361
00:22:12,960 --> 00:22:15,960
to make locust flower pancakes for me
with your own hands.

362
00:22:15,960 --> 00:22:18,680
You also promised
you'd care for me in my old age.

363
00:22:20,000 --> 00:22:21,400
We could have been
a loving father and filial son,

364
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:22,860
living happily together,

365
00:22:23,000 --> 00:22:25,070
but you had to turn things into this!

366
00:22:25,070 --> 00:22:27,670
Tell me, aren't you bringing this
on yourself?

367
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:31,160
Master.

368
00:22:33,350 --> 00:22:35,280
I have to thank you for striking me.

369
00:22:36,880 --> 00:22:37,750
With that,

370
00:22:39,070 --> 00:22:40,600
I consider the debt I owe you

371
00:22:41,270 --> 00:22:42,880
repaid.

372
00:22:48,480 --> 00:22:49,880
From this day forth,

373
00:22:50,750 --> 00:22:51,550
you

374
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:55,000
are no longer my master.

375
00:23:07,000 --> 00:23:09,930
The Soaring Dragon
Thousand-Mechanism Formation,

376
00:23:10,350 --> 00:23:12,210
using all things as instruments.

377
00:23:17,200 --> 00:23:19,110
The skills I taught you

378
00:23:19,720 --> 00:23:22,270
are enough to make you
the envy of the world!

379
00:23:24,240 --> 00:23:25,770
Talking about repaying me?

380
00:23:26,350 --> 00:23:28,150
With what do you plan to repay me?

381
00:23:47,200 --> 00:23:49,200
This is what it means to repay a debt.

382
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:58,160
To repay it in full!

383
00:24:29,400 --> 00:24:31,160
I'll give you one last chance.

384
00:24:31,680 --> 00:24:33,160
Serve Liluo,

385
00:24:36,310 --> 00:24:37,710
and I'll spare your life.

386
00:24:41,880 --> 00:24:42,680
Li San.

387
00:24:43,480 --> 00:24:45,440
You want me to side with demon-men

388
00:24:45,440 --> 00:24:46,770
and commit atrocities?

389
00:24:47,240 --> 00:24:48,570
Then between you and me,

390
00:24:49,720 --> 00:24:51,880
there's only a fight to the death.

391
00:25:01,480 --> 00:25:04,080
Then I suppose we have nothing left
to discuss.

392
00:25:25,200 --> 00:25:26,440
Seventeen years ago,

393
00:25:26,440 --> 00:25:29,480
Liluo took the lives of my parents
and my little brother.

394
00:25:29,480 --> 00:25:31,110
That debt must also

395
00:25:31,110 --> 00:25:33,190
be repaid in full.

396
00:25:37,440 --> 00:25:38,880
In this life,

397
00:25:39,400 --> 00:25:41,440
there's never enough wine to drink,

398
00:25:41,720 --> 00:25:44,000
nor enough grudges and debts to settle.

399
00:25:52,550 --> 00:25:53,810
When the wine runs dry,

400
00:25:53,960 --> 00:25:55,620
the grudge should end with it.

401
00:25:55,680 --> 00:25:56,920
Who would have thought that,

402
00:25:56,920 --> 00:25:59,590
somehow, your life would

403
00:25:59,590 --> 00:26:01,510
come to an end like this?

404
00:26:22,160 --> 00:26:23,420
Lord Constable Ghost.

405
00:26:23,480 --> 00:26:26,680
Are you looking for the Chiying tattoo?

406
00:26:54,350 --> 00:26:55,590
Lord Constable Ghost,

407
00:26:55,590 --> 00:26:57,110
did you see it clearly?

408
00:27:05,680 --> 00:27:06,830
I almost forgot.

409
00:27:06,920 --> 00:27:09,240
Seventeen years ago in this very place,

410
00:27:09,270 --> 00:27:11,350
I buried 2 things.

411
00:27:12,440 --> 00:27:13,270
Now,

412
00:27:13,480 --> 00:27:14,200
it's time

413
00:27:14,200 --> 00:27:16,680
to bring them back to light!

414
00:27:44,050 --> 00:27:44,850
Is it pretty?

415
00:27:44,960 --> 00:27:45,950
It is.

416
00:27:46,160 --> 00:27:47,290
It's pretty, right?

417
00:28:33,270 --> 00:28:34,670
Shen Jing'an.

418
00:28:35,880 --> 00:28:36,920
Your parents, whom you've searched for

419
00:28:36,920 --> 00:28:38,550
all these years,

420
00:28:39,000 --> 00:28:40,270
are right here.

421
00:28:50,230 --> 00:28:51,240
How about it?

422
00:28:51,400 --> 00:28:53,870
I left their bodies intact.

423
00:28:53,960 --> 00:28:56,620
That should be enough
to make it up to you, right?

424
00:29:18,270 --> 00:29:20,550
Come on, take them home
and lay them to rest.

425
00:29:20,550 --> 00:29:22,150
Give them a proper burial,

426
00:29:22,830 --> 00:29:24,310
with all due honors.

427
00:29:36,200 --> 00:29:37,970
Poor soul.

428
00:29:39,720 --> 00:29:40,990
Seventeen years ago,

429
00:29:41,110 --> 00:29:42,910
the one who killed your parents,

430
00:29:43,270 --> 00:29:44,930
wiped out your entire family,

431
00:29:45,000 --> 00:29:46,270
and abducted your younger brother

432
00:29:46,270 --> 00:29:48,330
to take someone else's place in death

433
00:29:49,880 --> 00:29:53,440
was me, Li San.

434
00:30:00,070 --> 00:30:00,830
Meng Rui!

435
00:30:02,000 --> 00:30:03,660
Whether you believe it or not,

436
00:30:03,790 --> 00:30:04,720
I also

437
00:30:06,000 --> 00:30:07,800
only found out about this today.

438
00:30:08,270 --> 00:30:09,480
But no matter what,

439
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:11,460
your family's tragedy

440
00:30:12,720 --> 00:30:14,270
is indeed related to me.

441
00:30:18,590 --> 00:30:19,830
I owe you.

442
00:30:27,270 --> 00:30:28,530
Lord Constable Ghost!

443
00:30:30,270 --> 00:30:32,390
I hope you understand that,

444
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,440
in this mortal world,

445
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:38,070
we are all but pawns in a greater game.

446
00:32:02,270 --> 00:32:05,470
Every grudge has its cause,
and every debt has its debtor.

447
00:32:05,480 --> 00:32:06,740
Lord Constable Ghost,

448
00:32:09,310 --> 00:32:10,310
draw your sword.

449
00:32:35,790 --> 00:32:37,100
Little brat.

450
00:32:40,000 --> 00:32:41,260
Does it look familiar?

451
00:32:45,200 --> 00:32:46,310
The puppet doll

452
00:32:47,590 --> 00:32:49,590
you've been searching for

453
00:32:49,590 --> 00:32:51,070
all these years

454
00:32:51,350 --> 00:32:54,830
is precisely my specialty.

455
00:33:01,070 --> 00:33:03,110
Then Wen Nansheng's puppetry...

456
00:33:03,680 --> 00:33:06,200
The one who passed the puppetry
to Wen Nansheng

457
00:33:06,200 --> 00:33:07,340
and had him cultivate

458
00:33:07,340 --> 00:33:09,240
the fruit of immortality of Tianmoluo

459
00:33:09,240 --> 00:33:10,030
was me.

460
00:33:11,480 --> 00:33:13,480
The one who told Tang Wei about
his background,

461
00:33:13,480 --> 00:33:15,350
taught him
the Illusion of Mirrors and Water,

462
00:33:15,350 --> 00:33:17,590
and secretly helped him seek revenge

463
00:33:18,960 --> 00:33:20,640
was also me.

464
00:33:21,640 --> 00:33:22,480
However,

465
00:33:23,070 --> 00:33:25,020
Wen Nansheng's puppetry

466
00:33:25,040 --> 00:33:26,350
was merely the basics.

467
00:33:26,720 --> 00:33:27,590
Today,

468
00:33:29,000 --> 00:33:31,640
let me show you, Lord Constable Ghost,

469
00:33:31,920 --> 00:33:33,920
what the real

470
00:33:34,480 --> 00:33:37,390
Five Wonders of Liluo can do!

471
00:34:21,920 --> 00:34:23,179
I was outmatched.

472
00:34:23,760 --> 00:34:24,949
I admit defeat.

473
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:28,480
What a pity—
after all these years of planning.

474
00:34:28,840 --> 00:34:29,840
Seventeen years ago,

475
00:34:29,840 --> 00:34:32,070
when you killed my parents
and little brother,

476
00:34:32,070 --> 00:34:34,199
did you ever think this day would come?

477
00:34:36,400 --> 00:34:37,710
The fear you feel now

478
00:34:37,710 --> 00:34:40,110
is nothing compared to what they suffered.

479
00:34:54,110 --> 00:34:56,090
This grudge goes back

480
00:34:57,190 --> 00:34:59,250
far longer than 17 years, doesn't it?

481
00:35:01,480 --> 00:35:03,550
It goes back 47 years.

482
00:35:05,480 --> 00:35:06,880
That day, when Tang Wei

483
00:35:08,070 --> 00:35:09,320
killed Huang Gang

484
00:35:10,360 --> 00:35:12,480
and beheaded Jiang Zeshui,

485
00:35:13,360 --> 00:35:15,020
