486
00:35:16,630 --> 00:35:17,890
Lord Constable Ghost,

487
00:35:18,280 --> 00:35:20,230
you are much luckier than Tang Wei.

488
00:35:27,190 --> 00:35:28,000
Come on.

489
00:35:28,330 --> 00:35:30,300
Do it.

490
00:35:40,590 --> 00:35:41,540
Hurry.

491
00:35:42,280 --> 00:35:43,290
No...

492
00:35:45,760 --> 00:35:49,230
Do it!

493
00:35:49,400 --> 00:35:50,190
No!

494
00:36:08,880 --> 00:36:10,040
Li Si!

495
00:36:18,550 --> 00:36:20,410
Meng Rui won't think to look for us

496
00:36:20,800 --> 00:36:22,480
at his own home anytime soon.

497
00:36:24,880 --> 00:36:25,940
Stand straighter!

498
00:36:27,150 --> 00:36:27,960
We should

499
00:36:28,800 --> 00:36:30,110
