511
00:37:16,800 --> 00:37:19,400
but you deliberately avoided
my vital points.

512
00:37:24,920 --> 00:37:26,070
I'm just getting old

513
00:37:27,070 --> 00:37:28,150
and past my prime.

514
00:37:29,840 --> 00:37:30,630
Li Si.

515
00:37:31,440 --> 00:37:32,230
No.

516
00:37:34,280 --> 00:37:35,510
I mean, Zhou Yan.

517
00:37:37,150 --> 00:37:37,960
Remember,

518
00:37:38,760 --> 00:37:40,870
you have to be ruthless

519
00:37:42,710 --> 00:37:43,850
to survive.

520
00:37:45,590 --> 00:37:47,720
If you're soft-hearted and hesitant,

521
00:37:48,510 --> 00:37:50,910
you'll never stand a chance against Liluo.

522
00:37:55,760 --> 00:37:57,560
There's no point in saying more.

523
00:38:21,820 --> 00:38:23,680
Now that things have come to this,

524
00:38:24,710 --> 00:38:25,670
do you have any

525
00:38:25,670 --> 00:38:27,110
unfulfilled wishes?

526
00:38:28,280 --> 00:38:29,070
I...

527
00:38:34,960 --> 00:38:36,880
I was born a citizen of Liluo,

528
00:38:39,280 --> 00:38:41,080
and I will die a ghost of Liluo.

529
00:38:43,150 --> 00:38:44,550
I have no regrets.

530
00:38:48,540 --> 00:38:52,760
♪ Night deepens, spreading like ink
over rivers and mountains ♪

531
00:38:50,230 --> 00:38:51,000
Master.

532
00:38:51,000 --> 00:38:52,230
When I grow up,

533
00:38:52,230 --> 00:38:54,760
I'll also make locust flower pancakes
for you.

534
00:38:54,760 --> 00:38:59,100
♪ I'm a spark that refuses to die ♪

535
00:39:00,490 --> 00:39:05,480
♪ Riding the wind, a thousand years
pass in a fleeting moment ♪

536
00:39:06,570 --> 00:39:11,870
♪ Seeking the song left unsung ♪

537
00:39:10,320 --> 00:39:11,110
Old man.

538
00:39:12,670 --> 00:39:14,070
But I still remember

539
00:39:12,940 --> 00:39:18,330
♪ Fleeting light fades
like fragile promises ♪

540
00:39:15,800 --> 00:39:17,200
that I owe you something.

541
00:39:19,320 --> 00:39:25,020
♪ Who softly sings along
from the far shore? ♪

542
00:39:25,610 --> 00:39:30,800
♪ I'm the poem
that keeps summer nights awake ♪

543
00:39:31,560 --> 00:39:36,870
♪ I'm amber
that defies the passage of time ♪

544
00:39:37,770 --> 00:39:43,300
♪ A fleeting glimmer
entwines with eternity ♪

545
00:39:43,740 --> 00:39:49,350
♪ Rewrite the loneliness of
time and space ♪

546
00:39:50,310 --> 00:39:54,750
♪ Let longing become ♪

547
00:39:54,000 --> 00:39:56,890
My hands are stained with
the blood of countless people,

548
00:39:56,890 --> 00:39:59,990
♪ Every word whispered on the wind ♪

549
00:40:00,150 --> 00:40:02,950
yet somehow I ended up
raising a disciple like you.

550
00:40:09,230 --> 00:40:10,280
I should never have saved you

551
00:40:10,280 --> 00:40:12,280
17 years ago.

552
00:40:15,960 --> 00:40:18,290
There is no cure
for the Chiying Bug Venom.

553
00:40:19,550 --> 00:40:20,590
You will eventually

554
00:40:20,590 --> 00:40:23,190
become nothing more than
a puppet of Liluo.

555
00:40:26,070 --> 00:40:26,880
Remember,

556
00:40:29,480 --> 00:40:31,010
the only thing in this world

557
00:40:32,750 --> 00:40:35,280
that can save your life is
the Ode to Canglang.

558
00:40:35,320 --> 00:40:37,000
Only the Ode to Canglang...

559
00:40:39,070 --> 00:40:40,510
can save your...

560
00:40:41,110 --> 00:40:41,920
life.

561
00:41:46,560 --> 00:41:49,590
♪ Capture my heart ♪

562
00:41:46,710 --> 00:41:47,510
Old man.

563
00:41:49,670 --> 00:41:50,480
Here.

564
00:41:50,190 --> 00:41:53,450
♪ Unravel my longing ♪

565
00:41:54,490 --> 00:41:59,770
♪ Can we relive the mark
you once carved deep? ♪

566
00:41:56,670 --> 00:41:57,840
Didn't I promise

567
00:42:00,000 --> 00:42:02,000
that I'd make locust flower pancakes
for you?

568
00:42:00,320 --> 00:42:03,650
♪ Turns out every soul ♪

569
00:42:04,210 --> 00:42:07,480
♪ Fears deep devotion ♪

570
00:42:07,480 --> 00:42:09,110
I worked so hard to make them.

571
00:42:08,440 --> 00:42:14,380
♪ In a moment, I fell,
a lifetime left to heal ♪

572
00:42:11,000 --> 00:42:12,440
At least take a bite.

573
00:42:14,840 --> 00:42:17,810
♪ Tossing and turning
through endless nights ♪

574
00:42:18,070 --> 00:42:18,880
Come on.

575
00:42:18,810 --> 00:42:21,710
♪ Breaking free from a labyrinth ♪

576
00:42:22,840 --> 00:42:28,000
♪ Will we meet again,
those I dare not face? ♪

577
00:42:28,940 --> 00:42:31,890
♪ One thought to ferry me
across the sea of suffering ♪

578
00:42:32,850 --> 00:42:35,750
♪ One thought to burn me to ash ♪

579
00:42:36,950 --> 00:42:42,920
♪ A thousand schemes can never be enough,
till all turn to dust ♪

580
00:42:43,190 --> 00:42:46,250
♪ Dare not forget ♪

581
00:42:47,200 --> 00:42:50,110
♪ No regret, no blame ♪

582
00:42:50,920 --> 00:42:56,650
♪ In love, I fear neither life nor death ♪

583
00:42:57,700 --> 00:43:00,190
♪ I turn a blind eye ♪

584
00:43:00,950 --> 00:43:03,740
♪ Who was it that cast the spell? ♪

585
00:43:04,920 --> 00:43:11,500
♪ Let my heart abide ♪

586
00:43:12,910 --> 00:43:16,810
♪ Forever within your shadow
by your side ♪
